  "description": "A robust .NET 8 library for handling OAuth2 Client Credentials and Password Grant flows with Elvid. Supports Basic Auth client authentication, multiple named clients, automatic token management with caching, retry logic, seamless HttpClient integration, and standard JWT Bearer authentication setup helpers.",
  "id": "Elvia.Elvid.TokenClient",
